/Alt (Flowchart illustrating a robotic action generation framework: \(a\) Data Input uses RGB images and bounding boxes; \(b\) Dual-Stream Vision Encoder processes context and fovea streams, generating object tokens; \(c\) Diffusion Action Generator with transformer backbone denoises action sequences; \(d\) Cross-Attention Injection refines action using multi-head attention on context and object tokens at each step; \(e\) Execution involves a controller executing action chunks for closed-loop robot control.)
/ID (ID.00639)
/K 1874 0 R
/P 1600 0 R
/S /Figure
/Type /StructElem
>>
